(7173263, 1101788, 108069, '<td valign="top">There''s such detail and yet blur that at a certain viewing distance this seems to vibrate. It''s either really, really cool or I might need some dramamine. Nice colors, nice entry.</td>', 'There''s such detail and yet blur that at a certain viewing distance this seems to vibrate. It''s either really, really cool or I might need some dramamine. Nice colors, nice entry.', '2014-02-08 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
