(7173385, 1101787, 63218, '<td valign="top">Fine work. Fun to look at the detail &amp; fun to just take it in. The detail seems to have a texture to it that implies watercolor paper. I imagine a dog &amp; a kid frolicking in the snow under a bright blue sky. I hope this gets a ribbon. A blue one would be nice!</td>', 'Fine work. Fun to look at the detail & fun to just take it in. The detail seems to have a texture to it that implies watercolor paper. I imagine a dog & a kid frolicking in the snow under a bright blue sky. I hope this gets a ribbon. A blue one would be nice!', '2014-02-09 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
