(7175530, 1101718, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent depth to this.  It''s one I find myself lingering over, and returning to.  Sometimes blur just "has it" for undefined reasons - this is one of those times.  Very well done.</td>', 'An excellent depth to this.  It''s one I find myself lingering over, and returning to.  Sometimes blur just "has it" for undefined reasons - this is one of those times.  Very well done.', '2014-02-13 00:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
