(7175689, 1101461, 108069, '<td valign="top">Super rich with great texture. Very well arranged throughout the scene, and blur sets it all off pleasingly. Very nice.</td>', 'Super rich with great texture. Very well arranged throughout the scene, and blur sets it all off pleasingly. Very nice.', '2014-02-13 10:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175693, 1101627, 138630, '<td valign="top">I love the way the blur accentuates the motion - he runs this way, they fly that way, the waves roll in at us.  Lovely layers of movement here.</td>', 'I love the way the blur accentuates the motion - he runs this way, they fly that way, the waves roll in at us.  Lovely layers of movement here.', '2014-02-13 10:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175696, 1101746, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  The movement suits the cold of both the subject and the tones.  There appears to be a pretty stiff breeze blowing the dry snow around at the surface - in contrast to the light and blue of the sky.  The dichotomy of a sunny winter day.</td>', 'This is very nice.  The movement suits the cold of both the subject and the tones.  There appears to be a pretty stiff breeze blowing the dry snow around at the surface - in contrast to the light and blue of the sky.  The dichotomy of a sunny winter day.', '2014-02-13 10:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175700, 1101647, 138630, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I especially like the way the blue one is coming in to embrace the white one.</td>', 'Nice.  I especially like the way the blue one is coming in to embrace the white one.', '2014-02-13 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175706, 1101585, 98339, '<td valign="top">sure looks like a Great White Egret to me...hmmmm  <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=ibis+bird&amp;newwindow=1&amp;espv=210&amp;es_sm=93&amp;source=lnms&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ei=_u38UpPND4TYyQGp9IHQDw&amp;ved=0CAkQ_AUoAQ&amp;biw=1536&amp;bih=757" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ibis - longer beak???</a></td>', 'sure looks like a Great White Egret to me...hmmmm  Ibis - longer beak???', '2014-02-13 11:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175707, 1101718, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle blurry mess, has a scifi feel to it.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Nice subtle blurry mess, has a scifi feel to it.  One of my top picks.', '2014-02-13 11:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7175708, 1101581, 70270, '<td valign="top">I keep going back and forth about this one.  Its very nice, one of my favorites in the challenge, and it is indeed a blurry mess.  But what I can''t figure out is whether the blurry mess is the subject or the photograph - is it just a picture of a blurry mess, or did you use camera movement and focus to create the blurry mess?  Will be interested to find out, but for now I am giving you the benefit of the doubt and bumping this back up to a 9.  Good luck.</td>', 'I keep going back and forth about this one.  Its very nice, one of my favorites in the challenge, and it is indeed a blurry mess.  But what I can''t figure out is whether the blurry mess is the subject or the photograph - is it just a picture of a blurry mess, or did you use camera movement and focus to create the blurry mess?  Will be interested to find out, but for now I am giving you the benefit of the doubt and bumping this back up to a 9.  Good luck.', '2014-02-13 11:09:37.000000', NULL, 1);
