(7176168, 1101746, 108069, '<td valign="top">Really nice. There''s almost a paper mache feel to the top half of the photo, then it drops down into some really nice faded contrast from dark to white, and the reflection is just for show. Quite beautiful.</td>', 'Really nice. There''s almost a paper mache feel to the top half of the photo, then it drops down into some really nice faded contrast from dark to white, and the reflection is just for show. Quite beautiful.', '2014-02-13 20:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
