(7176196, 1101528, 138630, '<td valign="top">Another favorite that I can''t find the words to describe.  The light helps.  And the tones.  Hate the title :)</td>', 'Another favorite that I can''t find the words to describe.  The light helps.  And the tones.  Hate the title :)', '2014-02-13 21:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
