(7176543, 1101740, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Venser:</b></div><hr/><i> Do you really get depressed over an online photography challenge? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>why not feel sad, blue, unhappy, or down in the dumps (the definition).<br/> <br/>It was an exciting challenge. I don''t do the abstracts very often, and I was quite exciting about doing and and the results I got originally. I enjoy putting my heart and soul into a shot. It doesn''t happen nearly as often as it should, but it''s fun when it does. :)<br/> <br/>Passion in photography is fun. I recommend trying it.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Venser: Do you really get depressed over an online photography challenge?   why not feel sad, blue, unhappy, or down in the dumps (the definition). It was an exciting challenge. I don''t do the abstracts very often, and I was quite exciting about doing and and the results I got originally. I enjoy putting my heart and soul into a shot. It doesn''t happen nearly as often as it should, but it''s fun when it does. :) Passion in photography is fun. I recommend trying it.', '2014-02-14 11:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
